@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_35_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:所有人都来到了会客厅。<br>在场没有一个人开口说话。|#0203Adv12_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛像在忍受着什么似的咬紧嘴唇。<br>|#0203Adv12_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Fearful1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅则是一副沮丧的模样，<br>抱着头苦恼不已。|#0203Adv12_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:得知安安的死以后，<br>其他人也因为这意外的打击而低垂着头。|#0203Adv12_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:至于我……我到现在依然没有任何真实感——<br>口里干渴，两脚发软，站都快要站不稳。|#0203Adv12_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@Wait WaitMode:1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:就在此时，典狱长出现了。|#0203Adv12_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀呀……<br>发生凶杀案件了呢。|#0203Adv12_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:最近这阵子明明那么和平……<br>果然你们还是无法抵抗那种冲动啊。|#0203Adv12_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那么接下来……<br>这次也请各位在审判开始前进行投票吧。|#0203Adv12_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:是我杀的……|#0203Adv12_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是无意识的喃喃自语。<br>回过神来，我已经说出了这句话。|#0203Adv12_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我的自首<br>让会客厅内的气氛骤然一变。|#0203Adv12_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗！？|#0203Adv12_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised

[PrintTextModified Text:你这话是什么意思！？|#0203Adv12_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Ema Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:这还能是什么意思，不就是像她说的那样……<br>希罗就是杀死安安的凶手。|#0203Adv12_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Hanna Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗……把安安给……|#0203Adv12_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Sherry Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么会这样……可是，为什么……|#0203Adv12_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Noah Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:都白费力气了呗。<br>就算再怎么继续玩好朋友过家家，<br>我们都已经……|#0203Adv12_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Miria Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Fearful1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，你……！|#0203Adv12_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我无法直视任何人的眼睛。<br>我只是低着头，静静等待投票结果的公布。|#0203Adv12_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:21_1
@SpawnBlur ActorId:MainBackground FadeDuration:0

@UpdateWitchBook Id:AnAn Category:Profile Version:6

[PrintTextModified Text:投票结果不用说，自然是我——|#0203Adv12_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.8 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:于是，我被拘禁在惩罚室里了。|#0203Adv12_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:眼前的景象朦朦胧胧，看不真切。<br>一切仿佛都在远方。|#0203Adv12_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（那时，艾玛是在……伪造现场吗）|#0203Adv12_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我突然想到了这一点。<br>可是就连这个念头也飘然远去，<br>感觉全身的力气正在从身体深处被抽走。|#0203Adv12_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（就算是这样，我也做不到保持沉默）|#0203Adv12_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就像昨晚，<br>安安再也无法忍受，向我们自白一样。|#0203Adv12_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从结果上来说，是我推了安安一把，害她掉了下去。<br>这是毫无疑问的。|#0203Adv12_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000FF Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:然后，安安死了。|#0203Adv12_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……！|#0203Adv12_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:每次呼吸都会加重我的苦痛。<br>我已经看不到任何希望，<br>受到拘束的身体完全提不起挣扎的力气。|#0203Adv12_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:没有任何人来探望我。|#0203Adv12_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText

; 荘厳な鐘の音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_33 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:4

[PrintTextModified Text:就这样——审判之时已到。|#0203Adv12_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

